2	//! store with each hole filled at its seat, a hole holding a template copied in turn. A sugar's
3	//! meaning (`means()`, a `Rewrite`) is copied beside the sugar, its holes nodes of the store it
4	//! rewrites; a generator's declarations (`Directive.source`) are copied into a store of their own,
5	//! its holes values. Each copied node reads its names where its template was written.
